_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-080-leyi"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["寡人","燕王","燕王喜"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p015","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/080.json"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p016","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/080.json"}],"rationale":"樂閒明示為樂毅子，樂叔明示為孫，不補闕代父親；樂乘為樂閒宗不補兄弟。燕王喜來書及趙襄王君序各限本段，曹相國未見名字不回填。河上丈人至蓋公師承不作父子。依本篇明示姓名、君序與來書答書範圍暫接；燕惠王來書寡人指惠王、將軍指樂毅，樂毅答書先王指昭王、足下君王指惠王。伍子胥引古首吳王指闔閭，後吳王在夫差賜鴟夷後指夫差。父兄與群臣不補具體親屬，王齊為反間假說不作授王爵。"},{"id":"d-shiji086-051","person_id":"lt4_hpv_4ku_AA","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-086-cike"],"status":"contextual_provisional","rationale":"依刺秦及篇末敘事暫接，蒙嘉之嘉限第34段，與代王嘉分開；燕王暫依第35段燕王喜承接，秦始皇及秦皇帝依第36段立號承接秦王。徐夫人不推定性別，所待客、家丈人與董生保留未名或氏稱；太史公口傳證據未作獨立核實。 第35段今王限代王嘉致燕王喜之書內，明示收信人燕王喜。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["燕王","燕王喜","今王"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-086-cike:p034","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/086.json"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-086-cike:p035","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/086.json"}]},{"id":"d-shiji088-021","person_id":"lt4_hpv_4ku_AA","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-088-mengtian"],"status":"contextual_provisional","rationale":"按本段明示姓名及局部承接暫定；引古人物只記正文所述，不補他書事件或年代。未名使者依不同奉命事件分置，曲宮段落使者與大夫按同段承接。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["燕王喜"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:p008","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/088.json"}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[{"id":"eq-shiji073-yanxi086","person_ids":["lt4_hpv_4ku_AA"],"canonical_person_id":"lt4_hpv_4ku_AA","scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-034-yan","c-shiji-073-baiwang"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-034-yan","source_id":"s-shiji-034-yan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-034-yan:p033","mention_ids":["c-shiji-034-yan:m033-0073"],"quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/034.json"},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang","source_id":"s-shiji-073-baiwang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:p009"